From 2dfadfe5350782c4e2c6643d0f1d5427c51aeb90 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: misc-de <misc-de@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 07:51:30 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] plugins: Contact card quick setting

Plinius: the own contact card for another phone, and cards from others,
through plinius-cardshare (org.plinius.CardShare on the session bus).
"Share My Card" offers the card for 30 s over NFC (the phone emulates a
Type 4 tag) and as a QR code on the status page, for phones without NFC
and iPhones; "Receive a Card" waits for an NFC tag with a card and for a
card pushed over Bluetooth. Received cards are listed until added to the
contacts or dismissed; "+30 s" and "Stop" below a progress bar.

The service does the work and puts NFC and Bluetooth back as they were;
the tile shows the time left. Nothing starts while the phone is locked.
A long press and the footer open Settings > NFC > Contact Card, where the
own contact and its fields are chosen.
